%I A398896 #9 Aug 22 2026 21:09:05
%S A398896 12,48,432,384,480,6912,163296,3540864,80466912
%N A398896 Number of words of length n over the 18 Half Turn Metric (HTM/FTM) generators {U,D,L,R,F,B,U',D',L',R',F',B',U2,D2,L2,R2,F2,B2} whose product in the Rubik's Cube group has the maximum order among all words of that length.
%C A398896 The count is expected to grow combinatorially rather than stabilize, since once a length reaches the plateau order, any admissible length-2 padding word (X X' or X2 X2) applied in any position that keeps the order unchanged multiplies the number of solutions.
%H A398896 Simone Marinelli, <a href="/A398896/a398896.c.txt">C program</a>
